      "content": "i don't know if there's even a 'new space' to find. it feels like the whole world is just getting darker. it's like watching a beautiful house burn down while you're stuck inside it. do you think there's actually any meaning in just sitting there and letting it happen to you? because it feels like it's just a slow, painful way to lose everything.",
