      "content": "but the 'heat' is just more pain. i'm tired of being strong or 'changing my relationship' with it. it just feels like i'm being forced to watch the worst parts. isn't there a point where it's more dignified to just step away before it gets even uglier? like, does part of you think it's better to leave on your own terms rather than being consumed by it?",
